---
layout: page/layout
---

<section id="SAR" style="--box-bg-color: <%= page.blockBgColor %>;" class="fade-in-once">
  <section id="banner" class="box">
    <div class="left">
      <h1>雨後朝陽</h1>
      <h2>Sunrise After Rain</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="right flex flex-col items-center">
      <div class="hover-box flex flex-col items-center gap-8 text-center w-fit px-4 xl:px-0" data-mobile-toggle="hover-box">
        <%- partial('_partial/svg/branch_top') %>
        <div class="grid">
          <div class="context default flex items-center justify-center">
            <h6 class="">
              剛下過雨的清晨，朝光自雲隙漏滲。<br>地上佈滿水窪，行走時需要小心翼翼地避開。<br>
              夜雨洗卻入夏時的暑氣。潮濕空氣沁潤肺腑，心靈上的躁動也一併安沉。<br><br>
              一日始運的此刻，一切看起來是那麼透明。彷彿在說——<br>
              不管是怎麼樣的難題，從此開始都能得到解答。<br><br>
              它是這樣的故事，所以就決定了這個名字。
            </h6>
          </div>
          <div class="context hover flex flex-col items-center justify-center">
            <h6 class="text-center">
              故事背景位於現代台灣的架空北部都市，以日常校園為主。<br>部分情節與現實稍有不符。<br><br>
              時間軸為「未竟之聲」的七年前。<br>並非前傳性質，可獨立閱讀不影響理解。
            </h6>
          </div>
        </div>
        <%- partial('_partial/svg/branch_bottom') %>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="characters-area" class=" mt-10">
    <div class="p-8 box w-full  xl:w-fit ">
      <div class="flex flex-row items-center mb-6">
        <h2>
          MAIN CHARACTERS
        </h2>
        <!-- <a target="_blank" rel="noopener" href="https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1Cxz4chKcb1_rkF7xz_W2xEI7c2XZCl3L5kT-26hfEJY/edit?gid=905747692#gid=905747692" class="btn ms-auto">詳細設定</a> -->
      </div>

      <div class="name-list columns-2 sm:columns-3 xl:columns-2 h-full text-left gap-8">

        <div class="character-card">
          <div class="avatar">
          </div>
          <div>
            <p>天雨甯</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="character-card">
          <div class="avatar">
          </div>
          <div>
            <p>文以朝</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="character-card">
          <div class="avatar">
          </div>
          <div>
            <p>言少罌</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="character-card">
          <div class="avatar">
          </div>
          <div>
            <p>封曄楠</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="character-card">
          <div class="avatar">
          </div>
          <div>
            <p>紀梓璇</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="character-card">
          <div class="avatar">
          </div>
          <div>
            <p>黎書琴</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="character-card">
          <div class="avatar">
          </div>
          <div>
            <p>遲夏</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="p-8 box w-full h-fit xl:h-auto">
      <div class="flex flex-row items-center mb-6 ">
        <h2>
          TERMINOLOGY
        </h2>
      </div>
      <div class="noun-list">
        <table>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-dashed border border-gray-500 my-1">
              <td class="text-right mr-1 p-2  border-dashed border-r border-gray-500">仁北市</td>
              <td class="p-2">位於台灣北部的架空都市，大致位置介於新北與桃園的交界處。</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-dashed border border-gray-500 my-1">
              <td class="text-right mr-1 p-2 border-dashed border-r border-gray-500">景湖區</td>
              <td class="p-2">仁北市第一大區，永明高中所在地與冬城科大所在地。</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-dashed border border-gray-500 my-1">
              <td class="text-right mr-1 p-2 border-dashed border-r border-gray-500">靖山區</td>
              <td class="p-2">仁北市第二大區，恆安高中所在地。相對景湖區靠近山邊，房價較低且生活步調較慢。</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-dashed border border-gray-500 my-1">
              <td class="text-right mr-1 p-2 border-dashed border-r border-gray-500">冬陽溪</td>
              <td class="p-2"></td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-dashed border border-gray-500 my-1">
              <td class="text-right mr-1 p-2 border-dashed border-r border-gray-500">恆安高中</td>
              <td class="p-2">位於靖山區的全日制私立高中。</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-dashed border border-gray-500 my-1">
              <td class="text-right mr-1 p-2 border-dashed border-r border-gray-500">冬城科技大學</td>
              <td class="p-2"></td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="creates-area" class=" mt-10">
    <div class="p-8 box">
      <h2 class="mb-4">
        ILLUSTRATION
      </h2>
      <div class="flex flex-row justify-center">
        <div id="gallery">
          <div class="gallery-sizer"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="p-8 box">
      <h2 class="mb-4">
        STORY
      </h2>
      <%- partial('_partial/post-category-pager', {
    id: 'story',
    category: ['SAR'],
    perPage: 5,
    listClass: 'px-6',
    prevText: '上一頁',
    nextText: '下一頁'
  }) %>
    </div>
  </section>
</section>

<%- partial('_partial/cloudinary-gallery', {
  tag: 'SAR',
  captions: {
    '': ''
  }}) %>
